   * is an abstract box that is extended beyond the `HitRect`.
   *
   * # Geometry
   *
   *  ┌────────────────────────┐
   *  │  ┌──────────────────┐  │ - Presses start anywhere within `HitRect`, which
   *  │  │  ┌────────────┐  │  │   is expanded via the prop `hitSlop`.
   *  │  │  │ VisualRect │  │  │
